<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman ups US Air, Continental.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman ups US Air, Continental.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said airline analyst Glenn Engel upgraded US Airways Group Inc to trading buy from market outperform.</p>
<p>-- said raised Continental Airlines Inc to the &quot;Recommended List&quot; from market outperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- US Airways gained 1-3/4 to 34-5/8.</p>
<p>-- Continental's &quot;B&quot; shares gained 1-1/4 to 35-3/4.</p>
</text>
